ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>意義<rt>이ˋ끼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-lì siṵ-lì m-jāi-u-siâ̰-ì-gī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>四界<rt>시ˋ괴</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>探聽<rt>탐ˋ턀ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>消息<rt>ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sì-koe lêh-thàm-thiâ̰ tô-wī u-lì’e siāu-sit\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>縛<rt>박-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>死死<rt>시ˆ시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà’e kâm-jiéng hor-lì pak-kâh-sî-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà mng-thḭ̂ goà mng-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>매<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>創治<rt>청ˋ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-e-tàng-mài-chòng-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>再<rt>재ˋ-</rt></ruby>애’릐 <ruby>折磨<rt>졛ˆ뽜ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kôh-jài-ai’li jiêt-boá si-goà kā-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>